    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d155">

                <pb facs="0334" n="246" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg246"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2824 <hi rendition="#superscript"
                        >2/16</hi></note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Chairman of the Commission of
                        Neutrals</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">White</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-09">January 9, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Chilean Chargé d’Affaires, Mr. Cohen, called at 5:20 p.m., and left with me
                    the attached telegram from Minister for Foreign Affairs Cruchaga. I immediately
                    gave Mr. Cohen a memorandum setting forth my views which he promised to cable
                    Cruchaga in reply. Copies of both memoranda are attached hereto.</p>
                <closer><signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">rancis</hi>] W[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">hite</hi>]</signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d155-a1.xml" xpointer="d155-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d155-a2.xml" xpointer="d155-a2"/>
